msgid "Basic Playback"
msgstr ""

#: manifest.json
msgid "Bottom control bar, open files and links, seek and speed"
msgstr ""

#: manifest.json
msgid ""
"The control bar at the bottom of the main window (seek bar, play buttons, volume); open a file, open a link, reopen the last file; several seek steps, keyframe seeks, jump to a time, fixed and custom speeds; an A-B loop that repeats a range a chosen number of times; time or thumbnail on seek bar hover; no screen saver while playing.\n"
"Playback… (Alt+4) in the right-click menu opens its panel beside the video: speed, A-B Loop, jump, frame and keyframe steps, seek steps."
msgstr ""

